<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX August gold - flat to up $1.00 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX Sept silver - off 2.0 to 3.0 cents</p>
<p>NYMEX Oct platinum - down $1.00 to $3.00</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - off $1.00 to $2.00</p>
<p>COMEX Sept copper - off 0.20 to 0.30 cent a lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
